{"type":"json_object","message":"I interpret the requested increase as the change in the unrecognized tax benefits balance over the two-year period from the beginning of fiscal 2007 to the end of fiscal 2008. I will use the beginning 2007 balance and the ending 2008 balance from the reconciliation table, both in $ millions: increase = ending 2008 balance - beginning 2007 balance.","tool":"calculate","arguments":{"expression":"ending_2008 - beginning_2007","variables":{"ending_2008":{"value":214.4,"source":"source:t8c1n0","unit":"$ millions"},"beginning_2007":{"value":70.5,"source":"source:t1c2n0","unit":"$ millions"}},"sources":{"ending_2008":"source:t8c1n0","beginning_2007":"source:t1c2n0"}}}